    "lp_sci_intro": {
      "type": "lp-sci-intro",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "LifePharm Empowers <em>Regeneration.</em>",
        "text": "<p>Your body already knows how to repair itself. Every cell has the ability to repair, renew and regenerate. It just needs the right signal to do it.</p><p>That signal is FGF-2. Fibroblast Growth Factor-2 is a protein your body produces naturally. It tells your cells to get to work: repairing, building new tissue and supporting healthy ageing from the inside out. The problem is that as you get older, your body makes less of it.</p><p>LifePharm was built to change that. Every product we make is designed to support your body’s own regenerative ability, not replace it. We give your cells what they need. Your body does the rest.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/healthy_aging.jpg"
      }
    }
